KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp

^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
libc++-20's sort chain fails because __unwrap_iter cannot be
resolved during __sort_impl's body elaboration. The template
IS in the scope (id_class=TEMPLATE) but the resolver doesn't
call guess_function_template_args for it. The pattern works in
isolation but fails in the full libc++-20 header context,
suggesting a scope/ordering issue specific to deeply nested
template instantiations in system headers.
